  "causebase_summary": "Aged Care Deloraine Inc is a not‑for‑profit aged care provider in Deloraine, Tasmania. Its website lists two residential care facilities — Grenoch (47 beds) and Kanangra (48 beds) — plus independent living units and occasional respite care. The site states the organisation offers specialised high‑care services, including dementia care, and names an Admissions Officer and a Clinical Care Coordinator who work with new residents and families to design individualised care plans. The website emphasises a homelike environment and staff support for residents’ social and mental wellbeing. The organisation states longstanding links with the Deloraine community and says it hosts local students on work placement. An ACNC AIS extract for 01/07/2022–30/06/2023 reports revenue of AUD 11,305,033 and total expenses of AUD 11,752,556 for the reporting entity. Sources for this card are the organisation’s website and the ACNC AIS 2023 extract; organisation‑authored statements are recorded here as claims made by the organisation.",
